Narrator: The desert sky deepens into darkness as the temple falls silent.
Anubis: Mortal. The hour of judgement has not yet come. Rest now.
Narrator: You settle in for the night, the stars wheeling slowly overhead...

<<fadetoday BackgroundManager>>

Narrator: Dawn breaks over the temple, golden light spilling across the stone.
Pharaoh: Awake, traveller. Today, you must prove your wisdom.
Pharaoh: Two doors stand before you, each sealed by an ancient ward.
Pharaoh: Find 𓀀 𓁐 𓃀 in the grid to open the door of the sun.
Pharaoh: Find 𓁷 𓎟 𓅓 in the grid to open the door of the river. #wordsearch

<<if $selectedPath == "Path_A">>
    Pharaoh: You have chosen the path of the sun. Light floods the chamber. 𓀀 𓁐 𓃀
    Narrator: A new dawn awaits beyond the threshold.
<<elseif $selectedPath == "Path_B">>
    Pharaoh: You have chosen the path of the river. Water rushes through ancient channels. 𓁷 𓎟 𓅓
